.TH CP "1" "July 2026" "PiggyOS" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
cp \- copy files or directories

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cp
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]... \fI\,SOURCE DESTINATION\/\fR
.br
.B cp
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]... \fI\,SOURCE\/\fR... \fI\,DIRECTORY\/\fR

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
Copy SOURCE to DESTINATION, or multiple SOURCE(s) to DIRECTORY.

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B \-f
if an existing destination file cannot be opened, remove it and try again

.TP
.B \-i
prompt before overwrite

.TP
.B \-p
preserve file timestamps

.TP
.B \-r
copy directories recursively

.TP
.B \-v
display a message for each operation

